{"id":"ef7dfd09239bb0b1","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-embedding-projection.md","title":"带结构参数的嵌入投影对","display":"df-embedding-projection — 带结构参数的嵌入投影对","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-embedding-projection","aliases":["16-df-embedding-projection","Embedding-projection pair"],"display":"df-embedding-projection — 带结构参数的嵌入投影对","depends_on":["[[16-df-cpo]]"],"source":"§10.6 p. 638 (PDF 658)","revision_date":"2026-10-15"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-embedding-projection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-embedding-projection</span><span>Embedding-projection pair</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-embedding-projection — 带结构参数的嵌入投影对"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d561a55729f9cdb8\" href=\"?note=d561a55729f9cdb8\" title=\"16-df-cpo\">16-df-cpo</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§10.6 p. 638 (PDF 658)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-15"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,E\">\\(D,E\\)</span> 为小 dcpo，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e:D\\to E\">\\(e:D\\to E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:E\\to D\">\\(p:E\\to D\\)</span> 为候选函数。连续性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d561a55729f9cdb8\" href=\"?note=d561a55729f9cdb8\" title=\"16-df-cpo\">16-df-cpo</a>；函数序为逐点序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}\">\\(\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}\\)</span> 保留源、靶偏序；在源靶已由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,p\">\\(e,p\\)</span> 的型属指定时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EP}(e,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{EP}(e,p)\\)</span> 为下文的局部简写。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}\">\\(\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EP}\">\\(\\mathrm{EP}\\)</span> 在本页定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ScottCont}\">\\(\\mathrm{ScottCont}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d561a55729f9cdb8\" href=\"?note=d561a55729f9cdb8\" title=\"16-df-cpo\">16-df-cpo</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}(e,p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(e,D,E)\\land\\mathrm{ScottCont}(p,E,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\land p\\circ e=\\operatorname{id}_D\n\\land(\\forall y\\in E)\\ e(p(y))\\leq_Ey,\\\\\n\\mathrm{EP}(e,p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}(e,p).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}(e,p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(e,D,E)\\land\\mathrm{ScottCont}(p,E,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\land p\\circ e=\\operatorname{id}_D\n\\land(\\forall y\\in E)\\ e(p(y))\\leq_Ey,\\\\\n\\mathrm{EP}(e,p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}(e,p).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：§10.6, p. 638 (PDF 658)。原书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Dcpo}^{EP}\">\\(\\mathbf{Dcpo}^{EP}\\)</span> 不要求底；因此此处用 dcpo 而非仅用本目录带底的历史 CPO。偏序仍是输入结构，不能仅由底层集合恢复。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-cpo","status":"resolved","id":"d561a55729f9cdb8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cpo]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cpo","status":"resolved","id":"d561a55729f9cdb8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D,E$ 为小 dcpo，$e:D\\to E$、$p:E\\to D$ 为候选函数。连续性见 [[16-df-cpo]]；函数序为逐点序。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cpo","status":"resolved","id":"d561a55729f9cdb8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}$ 及 $\\mathrm{EP}$ 在本页定义；$\\mathrm{ScottCont}$ 见 [[16-df-cpo]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D,E","display":false},{"tex":"e:D\\to E","display":false},{"tex":"p:E\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}","display":false},{"tex":"e,p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EP}(e,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ScottCont}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}(e,p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ScottCont}(e,D,E)\\land\\mathrm{ScottCont}(p,E,D)\\\\\n&\\land p\\circ e=\\operatorname{id}_D\n\\land(\\forall y\\in E)\\ e(p(y))\\leq_Ey,\\\\\n\\mathrm{EP}(e,p)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}(e,p).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Dcpo}^{EP}","display":false}],"bytes":1313,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-cpo]]、[[16-df-dcpo-function-space]]、[[16-thm-dcpo-exponential]]、[[16-df-embedding-projection]]、[[16-thm-ep-properties]]、[[16-thm-ep-bilimit]]、[[16-thm-inverse-limit]]、[[16-df-lambda-category]]、[[16-thm-domain-model]]。极限构造的完整证明是明示的本地补写；λ-category 按 §2.5 的指定反身对象接口定义。"},{"id":"fc728ef2e25025aa","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$(D_n,e_n,p_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$ 为小 dcpo 的链，$\\mathrm{EP}_{D_n,D_{n+1}}(e_n,p_n)$ 见 [[16-df-embedding-projection]]。"},{"id":"6d8f8949329afbbc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D,E$ 为小 dcpo，$\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}(e,p)$ 见 [[16-df-embedding-projection]]。"},{"id":"6cb45d716150df5b","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPO},\\mathrm{ScottCont}$ 采用 [[16-df-cpo]]；$\\mathrm{EP}_{D,E}$ 采用 [[16-df-embedding-projection]]。"}],"outgoing":["d561a55729f9cdb8"]}